[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0720","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0720.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0465","title":"Lynx 和 Microsoft Internet Explorer IMG 标签宽参数远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"远程攻击者可通过在网页中嵌入包含超大 width 参数的 IMG 标签，诱使目标用户使用 Lynx 或 Internet Explorer 浏览器访问该页面，触发浏览器在处理畸形 HTML 元素时的拒绝服务漏洞，导致浏览器崩溃。该漏洞影响 Lynx 及早期 Internet Explorer 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可实施攻击，危害等级高危。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0465"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:27Z","remediation":"升级 Lynx 至 2.8.1 以上版本可修复此漏洞；Internet Explorer 用户应升级至 IE 5.01 以上版本。当前建议弃用已停止支持的 IE，改用 Microsoft Edge 或 Chrome 等现代浏览器，并在 Web 应用中严格校验用户提交的 HTML IMG 标签 width 参数，限制其最大值防止拒绝服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0465","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad01ef67b360e9139b8072c8e614b7c7c1f658d2/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0465.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0465","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0465.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d279cde1e5f7d9e150ca373126c9b35476ad3f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0465.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/18de81c56daca1c9e33223f0b95bdb8312a1ca75/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3prc-hp8x-jp9c/GHSA-3prc-hp8x-jp9c.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0465.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/zephyros1603/RadiantProcessors/blob/7d44cb1cd4b9e088fbe463f1b19be50a04c2efe8/Backend/RAG/data/allitems.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82826/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/763b4dfa75aa1890a155aad1b583fdcab8111c49/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0465.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0720.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0720.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0694","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0694.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0454","title":"多款操作系统 TCP/IP 协议栈远程操作系统识别漏洞","description":"远程攻击者可通过向目标主机发送特制的 IP 或 ICMP 数据包，根据目标系统对异常数据包的不同响应特征（如 TTL 值、DF 标志位、ICMP 错误消息格式等）来识别其操作系统类型。该漏洞利用不同操作系统 TCP/IP 协议栈实现的差异进行被动或主动指纹识别，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可远程执行。使用 nmap、queso 等工具可自动化完成此探测过程，为后续针对性攻击提供信息支撑。该漏洞影响多种开源路由器及通用操作系统，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0454"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:25Z","remediation":"在边界防火墙上配置 ACL 规则丢弃不必要的 ICMP 报文（如 timestamp request、address mask request），并限制 TTL 回复行为；升级操作系统至最新版本，现代系统默认已缓解此类指纹识别攻击；使用 TCP 栈参数调优（如修改初始 TTL 值、禁用 ICMP 重定向）增加识别难度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2048","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0454.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1231f6f5f21cc87f3264c90adadd01cbb12e76ba/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0454.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0454","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/77fd3cf167afc5c82646a191836bcd2f9e51b459/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0454.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0454.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/18de81c56daca1c9e33223f0b95bdb8312a1ca75/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h9fp-2pjq-92gw/GHSA-h9fp-2pjq-92gw.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/763b4dfa75aa1890a155aad1b583fdcab8111c49/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0454.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82856/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0694.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0693","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0693.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0453","title":"Cisco CDP 设备信息泄露漏洞","description":"Cisco 设备上的发现协议（CDP）存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标设备的 1999 端口发送 SYN 数据包来识别 Cisco 设备的存在及类型。该漏洞允许攻击者获取设备信息，为进一步攻击提供侦察基础，影响大量 Cisco 路由器、交换机等网络设备。攻击无需认证，仅需网络可达即可实施，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0453"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:25Z","remediation":"在不需要 Cisco Discovery Protocol (CDP) 的接口上执行 `no cdp enable` 命令禁用 CDP，或在全局模式下执行 `no cdp run` 完全关闭 CDP 服务。在网络边界防火墙或 ACL 中过滤目标端口 1999 的入站 SYN 包，阻止外部扫描识别设备型号。升级到较新版本的 Cisco IOS 以获取 CDP 安全增强特性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0453","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1231f6f5f21cc87f3264c90adadd01cbb12e76ba/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0453.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0453","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0453.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/77fd3cf167afc5c82646a191836bcd2f9e51b459/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0453.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/18de81c56daca1c9e33223f0b95bdb8312a1ca75/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x3m2-cfrc-7vhc/GHSA-x3m2-cfrc-7vhc.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0453.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000430.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0693.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0692","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0692.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0452","title":"OpenSource Application 后门密码漏洞","description":"某开源应用程序的开发者在代码中预留了后门密码，导致未经授权的远程攻击者可通过该预设密码直接登录系统或访问敏感功能，完全绕过正常认证机制。该漏洞影响多个开源应用版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。受影响的系统管理员应检查并更换所有默认凭据，同时更新至已移除后门的版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0452"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:25Z","remediation":"立即审查受影响应用的源代码，移除所有硬编码的后门账号和密码；修改所有默认凭据为强密码；更新到已修复此问题的官方最新版本；如无法升级，在应用层和网络层同时实施访问控制，限制对受影响服务的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0452","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1231f6f5f21cc87f3264c90adadd01cbb12e76ba/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0452.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0452","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0452.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/77fd3cf167afc5c82646a191836bcd2f9e51b459/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0452.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/18de81c56daca1c9e33223f0b95bdb8312a1ca75/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q2g5-95p7-cx94/GHSA-q2g5-95p7-cx94.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0452.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/F/ftp_backdoor.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153100_153200.json","https://github.com/zephyros1603/RadiantProcessors/blob/7d44cb1cd4b9e088fbe463f1b19be50a04c2efe8/Backend/RAG/data/allitems.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0692.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0683","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0683.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0448","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 日志请求方法绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 及 Apache 等 Web 服务器在记录 HTTP 请求日志时，未对请求方法（Method）字段长度进行有效限制，远程攻击者可通过构造超长 HTTP 请求方法字符串，将实际请求的恶意 URL 隐藏在日志记录之外，从而实现日志绕过。该漏洞允许攻击者在未授权情况下隐藏攻击痕迹，影响运行 IIS 4.0 的 Windows NT 系统，增加安全审计和溯源难度。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0448"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:25Z","remediation":"升级至 Windows 2000 自带的 IIS 5.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复日志绕过问题。如无法升级，可启用 IIS 日志记录中的 URI 查询字段截断功能，并限制 HTTP 请求方法长度不超过 1024 字节以缓解攻击。Windows NT 4.0 已停止支持，建议尽快迁移至受支持的操作系统版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0448","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19149","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/727cf5277c8c23eaf8725829e26aff2ea619a86c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0448.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0448","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0448.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/77fd3cf167afc5c82646a191836bcd2f9e51b459/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0448.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/18de81c56daca1c9e33223f0b95bdb8312a1ca75/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2mhj-64gr-7wf9/GHSA-2mhj-64gr-7wf9.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0448.yaml","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/763b4dfa75aa1890a155aad1b583fdcab8111c49/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0448.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153100_153200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000429.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0683.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0683.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0683.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0637","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0637.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0398","title":"SSH Communications Security SSH 服务器过期帐户认证绕过漏洞","description":"tags.<value>SSH 1.2.27 和 2.0.11 版本在 Linux 系统中存在身份认证绕过漏洞，已过期的用户账户仍可通过 SSH 服务正常登录系统。攻击者可利用该漏洞通过已过期账户获取系统未授权访问权限，可能导致敏感信息泄露或进一步攻击。该漏洞影响运行上述 SSH 版本的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。建议升级到不受影响的 SSH 版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0398"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:18Z","remediation":"立即升级到 OpenSSH 3.0p1 及以上版本，或升级到 SSH 2.3.0 及以上版本。旧版 SSH 1.x/2.0.x 存在多项已知漏洞且已停止维护。如无法升级，可在 SSH 服务端配置文件 /etc/ssh/sshd_config 中设置 PermitEmptyPasswords no 和 UsePAM yes，启用 PAM 认证以强制检查账户过期状态。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0398"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0637.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0635","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0635.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0397","title":"Quakenbush NT密码评估器 网络明文传输密码漏洞","description":"Quakenbush NT 密码评估器（NT Password Appraiser）的演示版存在敏感信息泄露漏洞，该软件在评估密码强度时，将用户密码以明文形式通过网络传输，导致攻击者可通过网络嗅探方式截获目标系统的用户凭据。该漏洞影响 Quakenbush NT Password Appraiser 演示版，攻击者只需与目标处于同一网络段即可实施嗅探攻击，获取的密码可用于后续系统未授权访问。CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0397"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:18Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 Quakenbush NT Password Appraiser 演示版，改用完整版或其他密码评估工具（如 John the Ripper、ophcrack）。如必须使用该工具，请确保在网络层启用加密（如 IPsec 或 VPN）以防止密码明文传输。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0397","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/af5cedcf472f3690d94c4249ff35246f15692534/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0397.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0397","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0397.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ec31d5593e31331ed2058e001803e087d65aa416/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0397.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9qgw-6p5