E-1999-0388"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:17Z","remediation":"将 suGuard 中对 ps 命令的调用路径从相对路径改为绝对路径（如 /bin/ps 或 /usr/bin/ps），或在执行前将 PATH 环境变量重置为安全值（如 /bin:/usr/bin），防止攻击者通过篡改 PATH 劫持命令执行。建议立即停止使用已停止维护的 DataLynx suGuard，迁移到持续更新的替代方案（如 sudo 或 doas）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/3186","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19146","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f4ffb7bcd93209aa53a757a7ebdf17fe2a18eb33/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0388.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0388","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0388.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a75ebb477762f54f32c38d85ec939339ec2712e5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0388.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ggpc-mwvf-qx65/GHSA-ggpc-mwvf-qx65.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/1999/CVE-1999-0388.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1c737c62-180c-407a-8f21-cd64a33a52c3.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0622.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0598","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0598.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0364","title":"Microsoft Access 97 数据库密码明文存储漏洞","description":"Microsoft Access 97 存在数据库密码明文存储漏洞，该软件在创建受密码保护的数据库时，将用户设置的数据库密码以未经加密的明文形式写入外部的 MDB 文件头部区域。本地攻击者通过文本编辑器或十六进制查看工具直接打开该 MDB 文件即可从文件二进制数据中提取完整的数据库密码，从而绕过身份验证机制完全访问受保护的数据库内容。该漏洞源于 Access 97 在设计时未对存储的密码进行加密处理，影响 Microsoft Access 97 所有版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议用户升级至更高版本 Microsoft Office 或使用第三方加密工具对数据库文件进行额外保护。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0364"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:14Z","remediation":"Microsoft Access 97 已停止支持多年，建议立即迁移至受支持的 Microsoft 365 或 Office 2021 等现代版本。如暂时无法迁移，避免在共享网络位置存放含密码的 .mdb 文件，并使用 Windows EFS 或 BitLocker 对数据库文件所在目录进行加密，同时将数据库密码替换为 Windows 集成身份验证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91816470220259&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0cda26301f5b3e56ace35e3d98835812d878db41/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0364.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0364","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0364.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/638fc08494602a9faf37bf81043122f16d26625c/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0364.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6eca843f42fd99fea8c9b630931afac7c9d4576c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hvp5-q7xm-fj7p/GHSA-hvp5-q7xm-fj7p.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0364.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153100_153200.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--80c82ddc-bc10-4574-98b0-fe5e3ff3aadf.json","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/system-vulnerabilities/windows.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0598.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0592","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0592.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0361","title":"LaserFiche NetWare 版敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"LaserFiche for NetWare 版本以明文形式存储用户名和密码，导致邻近网络的攻击者可通过访问系统文件获取管理员凭证，造成敏感信息泄露。同时，系统允许管理员配置更改但未记录日志，使得未授权操作无法追溯审计。攻击者可利用窃取的凭证对系统进行进一步未授权访问与控制。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0361"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:13Z","remediation":"升级到 LaserFiche 现代版本（如 9.0 以上）以使用加密存储和审计日志功能；若无法升级，迁移至 Hyland 或其他具备加密存储与操作审计的文档管理平台。作为临时缓解措施，在网络层限制对 LaserFiche 服务的访问来源，仅允许受信任管理 IP 连接，并在 NetWare 服务器上启用文件系统和操作审计日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0361","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0cda26301f5b3e56ace35e3d98835812d878db41/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0361.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0361","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0361.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/638fc08494602a9faf37bf81043122f16d26625c/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0361.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b7a93df7f7051799495805bc211adea8d202dae7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7ch8-6pch-qhqg/GHSA-7ch8-6pch-qhqg.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0361.json","https://github.com/Spe